  title: Mauryan art and architecture
  text: Polished sandstone pillars crowned with animal capitals, such as the Lion Capital of Sarnath, now India's national emblem; the rock-cut Barabar caves; early stupas such as Sanchi; and the Didarganj Yakshi show the court art of the age.
